#ASSERT `the resident individual rates for YA` 2025 `on chargeable income of` 280000 EQUALS 36550
#ASSERT `the resident individual rates for YA` 2025 `on chargeable income of` 320000 EQUALS 44550
-- 320,000 to 500,000 at 22%: + 39,600
#ASSERT `the resident individual rates for YA` 2025 `on chargeable income of` 500000 EQUALS 84150
-- 500,000 to 1,000,000 at 23%: + 115,000
#ASSERT `the resident individual rates for YA` 2025 `on chargeable income of` 1000000 EQUALS 199150
-- above 1,000,000 at 24%: 200,000 x 24% = 48,000
