§§ `Section 43`

#ASSERT `the company rate for YA` 2025 EQUALS 17%
#ASSERT `the company rate for YA` 2006 EQUALS 20%
#ASSERT `the company rate for YA` 2009 EQUALS 18%
#ASSERT `the non-resident individual rate for YA` 2024 EQUALS 24%
#ASSERT `the non-resident individual rate for YA` 2023 EQUALS 22%
#ASSERT `the basis of charge for YA` 2025 `on` `a company` `, resident:` TRUE EQUALS `a flat rate` (17%)
#ASSERT `the basis of charge for YA` 2025 `on` `an individual` `, resident:` TRUE EQUALS `the Second Schedule rates for a resident individual`
#ASSERT `the basis of charge for YA` 2025 `on` `an individual` `, resident:` FALSE EQUALS `a flat rate` (24%)
#ASSERT `the basis of charge for YA` 2025 `on` `a trustee of another trust` `, resident:` TRUE EQUALS `a flat rate` (17%)
#ASSERT `the basis of charge for YA` 2025 `on` `a trustee of an incapacitated person` `, resident:` TRUE EQUALS `the Second Schedule rates for a resident individual`
#ASSERT `the basis of charge for YA` 2025 `on` `a Hindu joint family` `, resident:` FALSE EQUALS `a flat rate` (17%)

§§ `Partial and start-up exemptions (s 43(6)-(6D), (10)-(11))`

-- (6B), YA 2025, 300,000: 10,000 x 25% + 190,000 x 50% + 100,000 = 197,500
#ASSERT `the chargeable income taxed, after the s 43(6) exemptions, for` `a company` `, start-up:` FALSE `, YA` 2025 `, on` 300000 EQUALS 197500
-- (6D)(b): 100,000 x 25% + 100,000 x 50% + 100,000 = 175,000
#ASSERT `the chargeable income taxed, after the s 43(6) exemptions, for` `a company` `, start-up:` TRUE `, YA` 2025 `, on` 300000 EQUALS 175000
#ASSERT `the chargeable income taxed, after the s 43(6) exemptions, for` `a company` `, start-up:` FALSE `, YA` 2025 `, on` 8000 EQUALS 2000
-- (6A), YA 2015: 10,000 x 25% + 290,000 x 50% = 147,500 on 300,000
#ASSERT `the chargeable income taxed, after the s 43(6) exemptions, for` `a company` `, start-up:` FALSE `, YA` 2015 `, on` 300000 EQUALS 147500
-- (6D)(a), YA 2015 start-up: first 100,000 exempt, 200,000 x 50% = 100,000
#ASSERT `the chargeable income taxed, after the s 43(6) exemptions, for` `a company` `, start-up:` TRUE `, YA` 2015 `, on` 300000 EQUALS 100000
-- not for an individual or a trustee
#ASSERT `the chargeable income taxed, after the s 43(6) exemptions, for` `a trustee of another trust` `, start-up:` FALSE `, YA` 2025 `, on` 300000 EQUALS 300000

-- s 43(10): incorporated in Singapore, resident, 3 individual shareholders, incorporated for YA 2024
`a new private company` MEANS `Start-up facts` WITH
    `incorporated in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `resident in Singapore for the YA` IS TRUE
    `limited by guarantee` IS FALSE
    `number of shareholders, directly and beneficially` IS 3
    `all shareholders (or members) individuals throughout the basis period` IS TRUE
    `an individual held at least 10% throughout the basis period` IS TRUE
    `incorporated on or after 26 February 2013` IS TRUE
    `undertakes property development, itself or as a partner` IS FALSE
    `its only activity is holding investments, itself or through a partnership` IS FALSE
    `YA of incorporation` IS 2024

-- s 43(10)(b)(i): more than 20 shareholders
`a company of 25 shareholders` MEANS `Start-up facts` WITH
    `incorporated in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `resident in Singapore for the YA` IS TRUE
    `limited by guarantee` IS FALSE
    `number of shareholders, directly and beneficially` IS 25
    `all shareholders (or members) individuals throughout the basis period` IS TRUE
    `an individual held at least 10% throughout the basis period` IS TRUE
    `incorporated on or after 26 February 2013` IS TRUE
    `undertakes property development, itself or as a partner` IS FALSE
    `its only activity is holding investments, itself or through a partnership` IS FALSE
    `YA of incorporation` IS 2024

-- s 43(11)(c): only holding investments, incorporated after 26 February 2013
`an investment holding company` MEANS `Start-up facts` WITH
    `incorporated in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `resident in Singapore for the YA` IS TRUE
    `limited by guarantee` IS FALSE
    `number of shareholders, directly and beneficially` IS 3
    `all shareholders (or members) individuals throughout the basis period` IS TRUE
    `an individual held at least 10% throughout the basis period` IS TRUE
    `incorporated on or after 26 February 2013` IS TRUE
    `undertakes property development, itself or as a partner` IS FALSE
    `its only activity is holding investments, itself or through a partnership` IS TRUE
    `YA of incorporation` IS 2024

-- s 43(10)(b)(ii): limited by guarantee, 30 members including individuals
`a company limited by guarantee` MEANS `Start-up facts` WITH
    `incorporated in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `resident in Singapore for the YA` IS TRUE
    `limited by guarantee` IS TRUE
    `number of shareholders, directly and beneficially` IS 30
    `all shareholders (or members) individuals throughout the basis period` IS FALSE
    `an individual held at least 10% throughout the basis period` IS TRUE
    `incorporated on or after 26 February 2013` IS TRUE
    `undertakes property development, itself or as a partner` IS FALSE
    `its only activity is holding investments, itself or through a partnership` IS FALSE
    `YA of incorporation` IS 2024

-- s 43(10)(b)(i): no individual shareholder
`a company held by a corporate parent` MEANS `Start-up facts` WITH
    `incorporated in Singapore` IS TRUE
    `resident in Singapore for the YA` IS TRUE
    `limited by guarantee` IS FALSE
    `number of shareholders, directly and beneficially` IS 3
    `all shareholders (or members) individuals throughout the basis period` IS FALSE
    `an individual held at least 10% throughout the basis period` IS FALSE
    `incorporated on or after 26 February 2013` IS TRUE
    `undertakes property development, itself or as a partner` IS FALSE
    `its only activity is holding investments, itself or through a partnership` IS FALSE
    `YA of incorporation` IS 2024


#ASSERT     `a qualifying company under s 43(10):` `a new private company`
#ASSERT NOT `a qualifying company under s 43(10):` `a company of 25 shareholders`
#ASSERT NOT `a qualifying company under s 43(10):` `an investment holding company`
#ASSERT     `a qualifying company under s 43(10):` `a company limited by guarantee`
#ASSERT NOT `a qualifying company under s 43(10):` `a company held by a corporate parent`
-- the first 3 YAs: 2024, 2025, 2026
#ASSERT     `the start-up exemption applies to` `a new private company` `for YA` 2026
#ASSERT NOT `the start-up exemption applies to` `a new private company` `for YA` 2027

§§ `Gross-income rates for non-residents (s 43(3)-(5))`

#ASSERT `the gross-income rate for` `s 12(6) interest, commission, fee or other payment for a loan or indebtedness` `paid on` (YMD 2026 1 5) `, opted:` FALSE EQUALS JUST (15%)
#ASSERT `the gross-income rate for` `s 12(7)(a) or (b) royalty or payment for the use of movable property` `paid on` (YMD 2026 1 5) `, opted:` FALSE EQUALS JUST (10%)
#ASSERT `the gross-income rate for` `a REIT distribution to a non-individual without a Singapore PE` `paid on` (YMD 2030 12 31) `, opted:` FALSE EQUALS JUST (10%)
#ASSERT `the gross-income rate for` `a REIT distribution to a non-individual without a Singapore PE` `paid on` (YMD 2031 1 1) `, opted:` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the gross-income rate for` `income as a non-resident arbitrator or mediator` `paid on` (YMD 2027 12 31) `, opted:` FALSE EQUALS JUST (10%)
#ASSERT `the gross-income rate for` `income as a non-resident arbitrator or mediator` `paid on` (YMD 2028 1 1) `, opted:` FALSE EQUALS JUST (15%)
#ASSERT `the gross-income rate for` `professional income of a non-resident individual or foreign firm` `paid on` (YMD 2026 1 5) `, opted:` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 43(5): the 15th day of the second month after the month the payment is liable
#ASSERT `the last day to opt for s 43(1)(b), payment liable on` (YMD 2026 3 20) EQUALS YMD 2026 5 15
#ASSERT `the last day to opt for s 43(1)(b), payment liable on` (YMD 2026 12 10) EQUALS YMD 2027 2 15

§§ `Non-resident reliefs (ss 40A-40C)`

-- s 40B, only source: 15% x 100,000 = 15,000, not less than a resident's 7,950
#ASSERT `the tax with the non-resident relief for income` `as a non-resident employee` `, chargeable` 100000 `, from the source` 100000 `, assessable` 100000 `, only source:` TRUE `, resident tax` 7950 `, YA` 2025 EQUALS 15000
-- s 40B(3): not less than the resident's 20,000
#ASSERT `the tax with the non-resident relief for income` `as a non-resident employee` `, chargeable` 100000 `, from the source` 100000 `, assessable` 100000 `, only source:` TRUE `, resident tax` 20000 `, YA` 2025 EQUALS 20000
-- s 40B(2)(b): employment 60,000 of assessable 120,000: half the chargeable 100,000 = 50,000 at 15% = 7,500; the rest 50,000 at 24% = 12,000
#ASSERT `the tax with the non-resident relief for income` `as a non-resident employee` `, chargeable` 100000 `, from the source` 60000 `, assessable` 120000 `, only source:` FALSE `, resident tax` 3000 `, YA` 2025 EQUALS 19500
-- s 40A: a public entertainer has no resident floor since Act 41 of 2020
#ASSERT `the tax with the non-resident relief for income` `as a public entertainer` `, chargeable` 100000 `, from the source` 100000 `, assessable` 100000 `, only source:` TRUE `, resident tax` 20000 `, YA` 2025 EQUALS 15000

§§ `Rebates and remissions (ss 42A, 92J, 92L)`

#ASSERT `the parenthood rebate for a` `second child of the family` `, event on` (YMD 2025 3 1) `, citizen:` TRUE `, adopted before marriage:` FALSE EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the parenthood rebate for a` `first child of the family` `, event on` (YMD 2007 12 31) `, citizen:` TRUE `, adopted before marriage:` FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the parenthood rebate for a` `first child of the family` `, event on` (YMD 2008 1 1) `, citizen:` TRUE `, adopted before marriage:` FALSE EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the parenthood rebate for a` `third child of the family` `, event on` (YMD 2004 1 1) `, citizen:` TRUE `, adopted before marriage:` FALSE EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT `the parenthood rebate for a` `fifth or subsequent child of the family` `, event on` (YMD 2010 1 1) `, citizen:` TRUE `, adopted before marriage:` FALSE EQUALS 20000
#ASSERT `the parenthood rebate for a` `second child of the family` `, event on` (YMD 2025 3 1) `, citizen:` FALSE `, adopted before marriage:` FALSE EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the parenthood rebate for a` `second child of the family` `, event on` (YMD 2025 3 1) `, citizen:` TRUE `, adopted before marriage:` TRUE EQUALS 0
-- s 42A(3): 10,000 against 4,000 of tax: nil tax, 6,000 carried forward
#ASSERT `a rebate of` 10000 `against tax of` 4000 EQUALS `Rebate applied` OF 0, 6000
#ASSERT `a rebate of` 1000 `against tax of` 4000 EQUALS `Rebate applied` OF 3000, 0
-- s 92J, YA 2024, tax 10,000 with a local CPF contribution: (a) 5,000 - 2,000 = 3,000; (b) 38,000
#ASSERT `the company remission for YA` 2024 `on tax of` 10000 `, local CPF:` TRUE `, barred:` FALSE EQUALS `Company remission` OF 3000, 2000
-- tax 100,000: (a) 48,000, (b) 38,000
#ASSERT `the company remission for YA` 2024 `on tax of` 100000 `, local CPF:` TRUE `, barred:` FALSE EQUALS `Company remission` OF 38000, 2000
-- s 92J(2): 50% of 3,000 = 1,500 is less than the grant, so (a) is nil
#ASSERT `the company remission for YA` 2024 `on tax of` 3000 `, local CPF:` TRUE `, barred:` FALSE EQUALS `Company remission` OF 0, 2000
-- no grant: lower of 50,000 and 40,000
#ASSERT `the company remission for YA` 2025 `on tax of` 100000 `, local CPF:` FALSE `, barred:` FALSE EQUALS `Company remission` OF 40000, 0
-- s 92L(4): barred at disbursement — no grant, so 40,000
#ASSERT `the company remission for YA` 2025 `on tax of` 100000 `, local CPF:` TRUE `, barred:` TRUE EQUALS `Company remission` OF 40000, 0
#ASSERT `the company remission for YA` 2026 `on tax of` 100000 `, local CPF:` TRUE `, barred:` FALSE EQUALS `Company remission` OF 0, 0

§§ `Reliefs (ss 38, 39, 39A; Fifth Schedule)`

-- the base case: earned income 50,000, aged 40, nothing else
`an employee aged 40` MEANS `Individual relief facts` WITH
    `earned income` IS 50000
    `age reached by 31 December of the preceding year` IS 40
    `totally blind or permanently and severely disabled` IS FALSE
    `a female claimant (married, divorced or widowed)` IS FALSE
    `had a spouse living with or maintained by the claimant` IS FALSE
    `spouse's income in the preceding year` IS 0
    `spouse incapacitated by physical or mental infirmity` IS FALSE
    `payments to a former spouse under a court order or deed` IS 0
    `children` IS EMPTY
    `life insurance premiums, capped at 7% of the capital sum` IS 0
    `obligatory CPF or approved fund contributions as an employee` IS 0
    `self-employed: assessable income from the trade or profession` IS 0
    `self-employed: obligatory CPF contributions on that income` IS 0
    `self-employed: voluntary CPF contributions` IS 0
    `dependants` IS EMPTY
    `incapacitated siblings maintained` IS 0
    `course fees` IS 0
    `national service` IS `not an operationally ready national serviceman`
    `wife or widow of an NSman, claiming` IS FALSE
    `parent of an NSman, claiming` IS FALSE
    `SRS contributions` IS 0
    `SRS contribution cap` IS 15300
    `SRS account suspended, or the contribution withdrawn in the year` IS FALSE
    `grandparent caregiver: the caregiver's trade or employment income` IS NOTHING
    `CPF cash top-ups for family, after grants and capped as prescribed` IS 0
    `CPF cash top-ups for self, after grants and capped as prescribed` IS 0
    `prescribed deduction limit for s 39(3)` IS 8000
    `prescribed deduction limit for s 39(3A)` IS 8000
    `foreign domestic worker levy paid, for one worker` IS 0

